{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>I will set My face.</b> My face — I turn from all My affairs and attend to him (there)." "<b>In a man.</b> And not in the community (there), for the entire community is not cut off." "<b>For of his seed he gives to Molech.</b> Since it is stated ״מַעֲבִיר בְּנוֹ וּבִתּוֹ בָּאֵשׁ״ (Deuteronomy 18) — his son's son and his daughter's son, from where? Scripture says: ״כִּי מִזַּרְעוֹ נָתַן לַמֹּלֶךְ״. Disqualified seed, from where? Scripture says: ״בְּתִתּוֹ מִזַּרְעוֹ לַמֹּלֶךְ״ (Sifra; Sanhedrin 64)." "<b>To defile My sanctuary.</b> The congregation of Israel, which is sanctified to Me — as in ״וְלֹא יְחַלֵּל אֶת מִקְדָּשַׁי״ (Leviticus 21)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:07:23.553023589Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}